{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12308750","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12308750","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230875001:1":{"text":"意外ですし、私の命にかかわるかもしれないんです！","source_cn":"意外，而且很可能，还会要了我的命！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x649C8FF7F700E49A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230875002:1":{"text":"彼らは決死の覚悟で戦ってたはずなのに、ブラッディ・マリーがいきなり海のギャングを許したんですよ！","source_cn":"他们当初要拼个鱼死网破，结果血薇帮突然就放过水鬼帮了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x480D369DBF3631EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230875003:1":{"text":"そうしたら私はどうなります？私が売った武器で、海のギャングはブラッディ・マリーと戦ってたんですよ！","source_cn":"那我呢？我当时卖给水鬼帮的武器可是用来对付血薇帮的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x195A75D83896878B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230875004:1":{"text":"もし私が武器を売ってたことをブラッディ・マリーに知られたら……ダメだ、ここから逃げないと！","source_cn":"万一水鬼帮把我倒卖武器的事告诉血薇帮……不行，我要离开这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8315FD5D0E6032D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人邦辰":{"text":"商人のバンシン","source":"商人邦辰","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}